  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "STORY",
   "body": [
    {
     "intro": "You’re an ordinary office worker, living a quiet, peaceful routine...<br />\r\nUntil one night, you see your girlfriend walking close with someone familiar...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe betrayal hits deep...<br />\r\nYou cut them both out of your life...<br />\r\nBut the wound doesn’t fade...<br />\r\nOnly anger remains...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou swear you’ll never ride the same train as them again...<br />\r\nSo that night, you take a different train...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd there, you run into someone you know...<br />\r\nThe man's sister, Hibiki...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA simple coincidence…<br />\r\nThat awakens something twisted inside you...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd now, a \"chance\" for revenge stands right in front of you...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat would you do?"
    }
   ]
